      ],
      "source": "https://lewisham.gov.uk/inmyarea/history",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Ginger Baker, the legendary drummer who co‑founded Cream, was born and raised in Lewisham, adding rock heritage to the borough.",
